TC7_Longitude_above_upper_boundary

Test Case: Verify that the API rejects a longitude value above the maximum allowed boundary.

Method: GET

Endpoint:
https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast

Test data:

Latitude: 48.14
Longitude: 180.01

Steps:

Send a GET request with the specified latitude and longitude.
Check the HTTP response status.
Check the response body.

Expected result:
API returns an error response.
Request is not processed as a valid geographic coordinate.
